// Illustrations for the operation notes, taken from the clinic's own paper forms.
//
// Two things here are deliberate. First, these are the DRAWINGS ONLY - every English label
// was erased from the source raster and is re-typeset as SVG <text> in op-figures.jsx. The
// originals carry each label as a low-resolution bitmap that stays blurry however far it is
// upscaled; as vector text it is sharp on screen and at printer resolution, and it can be
// restyled or translated later. Second, the hernia plate is cut into its eight panels, so a
// record prints only the type that was selected instead of the whole comparison sheet.
//
// Embedded as data URIs rather than served from public/: an operation note is a signed
// record, and it has to print identically on a laptop with no network in Madagascar.

